# Throwaway scripts and their output. A script here queries production directly and writes real
# class hashes, portal user ids and document keys, none of which should reach the repository.
# The directory is ignored rather than a filename pattern, so no name is off limits to a script
# that is meant to be committed.
scripts/local
src/public/ai/dataset*
src/public/ai/screenshotDataset*

